    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Delightful 2 Bedroom semi-detached cottage style bungalow on a site extending to circa .30 hectares. (0.74 acre)\r\n\r\nA unique opportunity to acquire a charming 2 bed property in good condition throughout with lots of potential.  The front façade of this property shows a compact and cosy home accessed via gravel driveway.  The site which runs to the side of this lovely home is lare, extensive, mature and offers endless possibilities and privacy along with the potential for further development subject to the necessary planning permission. \r\n“Opportunities like this do not come up often and viewing is highly recommended”\r\n\r\nThis lovely home which has been carefully cared for over the years features oil fired central heating along with double glazed windows throughout.  796 Kilbeg is situated in a cul-d-sac crescent of lovely semi-detached and detached homes surrounded by a large circular green area to the front.\r\n\r\nConveniently located to local garage, shop, school and church Kildangan is a great community located just under a 15-minute drive to the M7/N7, Kildare Village, Kildare Train Station and Kildare town with its many amenities.\r\nAccommodation comprises; Entrance Hall, 2 bedrooms, bathroom and kitchen/dining room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\nEntrance Porch:  \tWith radiator\r\nBedroom 1:\t\tDouble bedroom with solid fuel stove and radiator\t\r\nBedroom 2:\t\tSingle bedroom with radiator\r\nBathroom: \t\tSpacious bathroom with bath with walk-in shower (electric). Also including whb and wc. Fully tiled throughout\r\nAlso incorporating Whb and Wc.  Fully tiled throughout.\r\nKitchen/Dining Area:  With built-in stove insert, built in presses and free-standing cooker.\r\n\t\t\t        Also incorporating hot-press with storage. Back door to rear of property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSituated on a generous site extending to c.irca .30 hectares (0.74 acre site)\r\n•\tShort proximity of local school, montessori, shop, garage and church.\r\n•\tOil Fired Central Heating (stove insert in kitchen/dining room)\r\n•\tStove inset in fireplace.\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows throughout.\r\n•\tGravel driveway \r\n•\tSite lends itself to endless further expansion subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n•\tSeptic tank on site.\r\n•\tBER F\r\n•\tOutside out houses for extra storage.\r\n•\tPvc gutters, facias and soffits.\r\n•\tOutside storage sheds"
      },
